{"dog":{"age_group":"senior","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nAmber might be 12 years young but she has proven that she can keep up for long walks. During her stay with us for the weekend, she was able to walk for 2-3 miles with us with no issues. She is perfectly house trained and loved to be left alone to sleep off the steps she just did. She loves all sort of affection and attention from any humans and will whine if you stop! Amber is an extremely loving senior who just wants affection, a warm meal, and a comfy bed to lay down. She is the golden girl that deserves to be in your heart and home, come meet this girl at Queens ACC!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=5&searchType=4&animalid=209714","id":"052fb34208094d26e6ba1daa261d9759","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6eae48cdb22d40a58abd40a795101885-1793723249-1793723252-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/13aff1573fa347a4a21ccea593a53cf3-1792514321-1792514337-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ebb98eaa58144344b9b4a9fe03270e9f-1792514321-1792514321-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4c285fdc0bd44a97a75571e697fe8983-1792514321-1792514321-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/14ad3013ac0e4f6a89754baab50cee50-1795384161-1795384249-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6cf577b8c90c4978bf0a1a55d1bc6963-1795384161-1795384241-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5427fa93ffba4f64b9a9c554e8a29d1d-1795384161-1795384235-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/22b8d9f41ea640bc90eab6530aad1dc9-1795384162-1795384205-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.s